1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:04,040
[September 25, 1999]

2
00:00:05,249 --> 00:00:10,271
I came to Australia when I was five.
My life hasn't been easy.

3
00:00:10,271 --> 00:00:14,011
And I thought of committing suicide so many times.

4
00:00:14,011 --> 00:00:20,012
But I thought, you know, I've got to put up with it
because I have to get revenge on my parents

5
00:00:20,012 --> 00:00:23,552
who threw me out just like garbage.

6
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:30,305
I was about 9 when I was adopted from the orphanage.

7
00:00:31,302 --> 00:00:36,391
Korean? Yeah, I know the language but I don't use it.

8
00:00:36,515 --> 00:00:40,727
I don't even want to think about the goddamn country.

9
00:00:41,202 --> 00:00:44,420
What would I say to my mother
who abandoned me if I met her?

10
00:00:45,588 --> 00:00:47,639
Go to hell!

11
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:54,720
Don't remember. I was adopted when I was two.

12
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:56,880
[Danny Anderson
- Korean name: Cha Muhyeok (age 22)]

13
00:00:56,880 --> 00:01:02,340
Korean? I'm great at it. My girlfriend taught me.

14
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:06,430
"Oh, my goodness!" "Gosh darn it!" "Yes!"

15
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:08,260
I know all those phrases.

16
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:11,977
This is my girlfriend Jiyeong.

17
00:01:14,955 --> 00:01:18,100
To my mother? I understand.

18
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:22,790
She probably had her reasons.
No one would ditch their child like that.

19
00:01:22,790 --> 00:01:28,150
Stuff happens.
Maybe she was too poor to even feed me milk

20
00:01:28,150 --> 00:01:31,350
and gave me up so I could have a better life.

21
00:01:31,350 --> 00:01:33,465
Tommy!

22
00:01:34,473 --> 00:01:37,879
Bad boy. Sit. Sit!

23
00:01:41,630 --> 00:01:44,050
I'll meet my poor mother one day.

24
00:01:44,050 --> 00:01:49,340
I'll buy her some pretty clothes,
some BBQ meat, and a beautiful house.

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,980
Mom, I'll go there and let you live in luxury.

26
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:58,070
Just wait five years!

27
00:02:00,672 --> 00:02:02,461
Just five years! Okay?

28
00:02:03,330 --> 00:02:07,410
It was good but this guy doesn't
match our show concept.

29
00:02:07,410 --> 00:02:08,680
I know, right?

30
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:12,180
And why can't he speak proper Korean? Annoying.

31
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:13,520
I'll do some editing.

32
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,070
Don't you have better footage?

33
00:02:16,070 --> 00:02:17,850
I'll look for some.

34
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:22,700
[Special Program: Overseas Adoptions
-  "I Hate Korea" Editing in Session]

35
00:02:31,700 --> 00:02:34,110
[Episode 1]

36
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:16,870
[Five years later...]

37
00:04:16,161 --> 00:04:19,733
Hello. Do you need help?

38
00:04:22,865 --> 00:04:25,760
- Where are you from?
- Japan.

39
00:04:26,172 --> 00:04:31,370
[Speaking Japanese] Really? Nice to meet you.
I'm also Japanese.

40
00:04:31,370 --> 00:04:33,980
You are? Nice to meet you.

41
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:37,510
What a relief!

42
00:04:38,210 --> 00:04:40,910
Get in. I'll drive you.

43
00:04:40,910 --> 00:04:43,580
Really? Thank you!

44
00:04:51,890 --> 00:04:55,290
Thank you. Thank you.

45
00:04:55,290 --> 00:05:00,880
I came here on a trip but my English is lousy.

46
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:03,740
I'd been worrying so much.

47
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:06,180
Thank goodness.

48
00:05:07,843 --> 00:05:10,966
Leave your bag and get out the car quietly, girl.

49
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:29,130
You rotten bastards! Give back my bags!

50
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:37,248
Dang! We got some dough now!

51
00:05:43,292 --> 00:05:46,209
What the hell? Two is missing.

52
00:05:47,618 --> 00:05:53,029
Make sure you split half. Before I cut your hands off.

53
00:06:00,570 --> 00:06:03,834
Yeah, we got some dough now! It's time to party!

54
00:06:03,834 --> 00:06:07,327
- I need it for something else.
- What?

55
00:06:08,538 --> 00:06:12,676
Jiyeong's gift. It's my wife's birthday tomorrow.

56
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,190
Hello, Kang Minju!

57
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:35,640
I'm Song from "Behind The Camera News."

58
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,820
Apparently the rumors that you two
got married are true?

59
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:40,520
Congratulations.

60
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:44,650
Thanks. "Behind the Camera"
informants are really incredible.

61
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:49,930
Hey, lady. Married? Who got married?

62
00:06:49,930 --> 00:06:52,990
- Aren't we getting married?
- What?

63
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:56,790
Were you just playing with me then?

64
00:07:00,470 --> 00:07:04,090
We did it!

65
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:06,150
Thanks, Eunchae!

66
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:10,040
I'm not doing this again.

67
00:07:11,180 --> 00:07:15,910
I'm serious. Do this to me again...
and I'll never speak to you again.

68
00:07:15,910 --> 00:07:17,230
Alright.

69
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:20,680
You should settle down already.

70
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:26,890
Live and love one man. Stop being such a floozy.

71
00:07:26,890 --> 00:07:28,560
Hey, Kang Minju!

72
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:32,810
Song Eunchae! What do you think love is?

73
00:07:32,810 --> 00:07:36,270
To me, love's just a game.

74
00:07:36,270 --> 00:07:38,180
Like Starcraft.

75
00:07:48,770 --> 00:07:52,440
Hey, baby! How have you been?

76
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:56,120
Sure. Let's meet there.

77
00:07:56,120 --> 00:08:00,810
I'm in the middle of filming, so I'll see you later.

78
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:04,820
Honey!

79
00:08:04,820 --> 00:08:08,860
No, I'm not busy.

80
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:12,470
Don't you miss me?

81
00:08:12,470 --> 00:08:16,180
[I don't want to live, Eunchae From: Our Star]

82
00:08:30,831 --> 00:08:32,547
[The only phone superstars
Choi Yun & Kang Minju use!]

83
00:09:10,870 --> 00:09:13,380
Choi Yun!

84
00:09:16,010 --> 00:09:17,950
Come in. I'm in the bathroom.

85
00:09:23,570 --> 00:09:25,860
Get in! What are you doing?

86
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:37,780
What's the matter now? Why don't you want to live?

87
00:09:37,780 --> 00:09:43,070
She ignored my text.

88
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:46,370
Even though I sent her two.

89
00:09:50,130 --> 00:09:52,350
But it's not broken.

90
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:55,400
What did you send?

91
00:09:58,690 --> 00:10:01,400
"I'm looking forward to our trip together."

92
00:10:05,780 --> 00:10:07,390
Is it corny?

93
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:13,040
I want to become your special someone!

94
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,720
That's corny, huh?

95
00:10:17,610 --> 00:10:19,400
Cheesy, huh?

96
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:22,820
Hey, Song Eunchae!

97
00:10:24,860 --> 00:10:27,140
It won't work out with Minju.

98
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:28,370
Why not?

99
00:10:28,970 --> 00:10:33,360
It's just... I don't think she's right for you.

100
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:39,970
So... You're saying I'm not in her league?

101
00:10:39,970 --> 00:10:41,840
No, not that...

102
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,800
Whatever.

103
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,650
So embarrassing...

104
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:49,130
I just wanna die!

105
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:01,710
Yun!

106
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,220
Oh, Yun!

107
00:11:05,220 --> 00:11:07,880
Yun, Yun! Yun!

108
00:11:15,700 --> 00:11:17,920
I trust only you, Song Eunchae!

109
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:23,120
Help make Kang Minju mine no matter what!

110
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:26,820
Come on, help me out!

111
00:11:26,820 --> 00:11:31,350
She always listens to everything you say. Come on.

112
00:11:33,410 --> 00:11:34,400
Fine.

113
00:11:36,250 --> 00:11:37,450
Oh, my!

114
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:44,660
Hey, do you see me as a man?

115
00:12:05,390 --> 00:12:07,580
Go in and wash, too.

116
00:14:21,887 --> 00:14:24,081
- What are we gonna do?
- I don't know.

117
00:14:27,003 --> 00:14:29,113
- Do you wanna get out of here?
- Yeah.

118
00:14:30,788 --> 00:14:33,561
Just leave it. I got it.

119
00:15:42,089 --> 00:15:45,996
This dress... Can you wrap it?

120
00:15:46,568 --> 00:15:49,629
That dress is very expensive.

121
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:06,219
This is enough, right?

122
00:16:06,219 --> 00:16:09,895
- Give me your hand, baby. You like?
- I love it.

123
00:16:10,083 --> 00:16:13,396
- You like?
- I love it. Thank you, Jason.

124
00:16:13,396 --> 00:16:15,947
- It looks beautiful.
- Thanks.

125
00:16:15,947 --> 00:16:20,923
What else would you like, baby?
That's beautiful, that dress over there...

126
00:16:35,049 --> 00:16:38,237
Sorry. Please understand.

127
00:16:40,290 --> 00:16:42,930
Jason is waiting.

128
00:16:42,930 --> 00:16:44,540
I'll get going.

129
00:16:47,021 --> 00:16:48,291
I love you!

130
00:16:49,340 --> 00:16:50,780
I love you, Jiyeong!

131
00:16:50,780 --> 00:16:52,210
I do, too.

132
00:16:52,210 --> 00:16:55,840
I love you more than anything in the world.

133
00:16:55,840 --> 00:17:00,180
But... I love Jason's money more.

134
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,760
I hope to see you at my wedding.

135
00:17:14,464 --> 00:17:19,471
[I'm Sorry, I Love You]

136
00:17:39,100 --> 00:17:40,870
What's on the schedule for today?

137
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:45,880
We'll film an ad today, followed by some TV interviews.

138
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,200
Okay.

139
00:19:34,420 --> 00:19:37,050
Great job, thank you!

140
00:19:41,070 --> 00:19:42,610
Hang it over there.

141
00:19:44,670 --> 00:19:45,890
Yun.

142
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,910
How was your day?

143
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:55,370
It was good.

144
00:19:57,370 --> 00:19:59,080
One moment!

145
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:08,090
- Minju?
- Eunchae, come here.

146
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:12,580
What's up?

147
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,300
Ta-da!

148
00:20:14,300 --> 00:20:16,150
- What is that?
- Wine.

149
00:20:16,150 --> 00:20:20,940
You know, the Napoleon sort of wine...
A present from a fan!

150
00:20:20,940 --> 00:20:22,450
Wow!

151
00:20:22,450 --> 00:20:24,470
Wanna come over to my hotel tonight?
Let's drink it together.

152
00:20:24,470 --> 00:20:25,690
Sure! Why not?

153
00:20:25,690 --> 00:20:27,690
Can I be included?

154
00:20:30,180 --> 00:20:35,230
Is it alright if I include myself?

155
00:20:36,100 --> 00:20:39,470
If you come, the honor will be mine.

156
00:20:40,130 --> 00:20:42,930
Eunchae! Come together today!

157
00:20:42,930 --> 00:20:44,080
Sure.

158
00:21:00,170 --> 00:21:02,850
Is love like Starcraft to you, too?

159
00:21:02,850 --> 00:21:03,970
What?

160
00:21:05,110 --> 00:21:07,320
Is love a game to you, too?

161
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:11,160
Who says love is like Starcraft?

162
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,760
Minju?

163
00:21:12,760 --> 00:21:16,760
No. Just someone I know.

164
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:19,510
Don't hang out with that person, whoever it is.

165
00:21:19,510 --> 00:21:23,210
My innocent Eunchae! Are you in shock?

166
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:28,530
Can't you also think of love as a game?

167
00:21:30,740 --> 00:21:35,820
If the person you love ever betrays you...

168
00:21:35,820 --> 00:21:38,950
Or destroys you inside, try not to be hurt by it.

169
00:21:38,950 --> 00:21:40,630
Does that work for you?

170
00:21:41,550 --> 00:21:42,690
Yes!

171
00:21:47,780 --> 00:21:49,250
Yun!

172
00:21:49,250 --> 00:21:50,530
Yun! Yun!

173
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:58,090
Eunchae!

174
00:21:58,880 --> 00:22:02,370
Yun, are you okay? Are you hurt?

175
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,450
Does it hurt?

176
00:23:53,060 --> 00:23:54,620
It burns, doesn't it?

177
00:23:57,430 --> 00:24:02,330
Doesn't he know how to drive?
That bastard is dead meat if I catch him.

178
00:24:02,330 --> 00:24:05,170
- It's fine...
- How is it fine?

179
00:24:06,460 --> 00:24:08,840
Shouldn't you see a doctor?

180
00:24:08,840 --> 00:24:10,540
I'm fine!

181
00:24:10,540 --> 00:24:12,450
What do you mean you're fine?

182
00:24:12,450 --> 00:24:16,360
You're still so young and
your face is a mess. It's not fine!

183
00:24:20,010 --> 00:24:21,810
Let me see your face.

184
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:30,140
This might become a scar.

185
00:24:31,450 --> 00:24:34,990
How can a pretty face have scars?

186
00:24:37,890 --> 00:24:43,240
This is so depressing to me.

187
00:24:45,450 --> 00:24:46,680
Yun...

188
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:49,580
Need to go to the bathroom? Want me to escort you?

189
00:24:49,580 --> 00:24:53,400
No! Minju's probably waiting.

190
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:56,720
I don't think I can go like this.
So wanna go by yourself?

191
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:59,420
How can I leave you alone when you're like this?

192
00:24:59,420 --> 00:25:01,660
Go. You want to, don't you?

193
00:25:01,660 --> 00:25:03,800
Hey, how can I leave you here, huh?

194
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:05,610
Take off your clothes...

195
00:25:05,610 --> 00:25:08,800
You probably have other scrapes.
I'll bandage them for you.

196
00:25:09,670 --> 00:25:12,170
Just go. People will get the wrong idea.

197
00:25:12,170 --> 00:25:15,040
Let them get the wrong idea.

198
00:25:15,040 --> 00:25:17,710
If a scandal breaks out, we can just marry.

199
00:25:20,350 --> 00:25:22,020
I want to sleep. I'm sleepy.

200
00:25:22,020 --> 00:25:23,920
Want to hear a lullaby?

201
00:25:43,144 --> 00:25:46,890
♪ Love me tender ♪

202
00:25:46,890 --> 00:25:48,840
You don't have to...

203
00:25:48,840 --> 00:25:50,730
Just listen!

204
00:25:50,730 --> 00:25:53,800
Korea's number one singer is singing you a lullaby.

205
00:25:56,339 --> 00:26:00,994
♪ Love me tender ♪

206
00:26:00,994 --> 00:26:04,050
♪ Love me sweet ♪

207
00:26:04,050 --> 00:26:09,157
♪ Never let me go ♪

208
00:26:09,157 --> 00:26:16,657
♪ You have made my life complete ♪

209
00:26:16,657 --> 00:26:24,849
♪ And I love you so ♪

210
00:27:21,030 --> 00:27:22,340
Sleeping?

211
00:27:24,380 --> 00:27:26,160
Eunchae. Are you sleeping?

212
00:27:47,530 --> 00:27:51,300
Yeah, Minju. It's Yu.

213
00:27:51,300 --> 00:27:55,110
I'll be there now. It's not too late, right?

214
00:27:55,110 --> 00:27:58,410
Also, stay behind tomorrow.

215
00:27:58,410 --> 00:28:00,350
Just do it.

216
00:28:00,350 --> 00:28:05,620
Tell your manager to go back first, and stay behind.

217
00:28:05,620 --> 00:28:07,170
All right?

218
00:29:37,590 --> 00:29:39,370
Hi, need some help?

219
00:29:40,999 --> 00:29:42,096
Airport...

220
00:29:42,096 --> 00:29:47,957
- Airport?
- Thank you! Thank you!

221
00:29:54,653 --> 00:29:56,730
- Thanks.
- You're welcome, sir.

222
00:29:56,730 --> 00:29:58,050
Eunchae!

223
00:30:00,370 --> 00:30:01,700
Song Eunchae!

224
00:30:04,310 --> 00:30:06,020
Song Eunchae!

225
00:30:14,170 --> 00:30:16,940
Something came up. I'm heading back to Seoul.

226
00:30:16,940 --> 00:30:18,700
See you in Seoul!

227
00:30:19,530 --> 00:30:21,550
You left without a goodbye?

228
00:30:30,330 --> 00:30:33,140
Thieves! Robbers!

229
00:30:33,140 --> 00:30:35,080
You bastards!

230
00:30:42,610 --> 00:30:44,950
Eunchae left this morning?

231
00:30:44,950 --> 00:30:45,830
Yeah...

232
00:30:45,830 --> 00:30:48,010
Why so suddenly?

233
00:30:49,730 --> 00:30:53,920
She was supposed to hang out with me.

234
00:30:55,390 --> 00:30:59,070
I should be going back then, too.

235
00:30:59,070 --> 00:31:02,370
Can you change my flight to today?

236
00:31:02,370 --> 00:31:04,530
I told you to stay behind!

237
00:31:04,530 --> 00:31:06,480
What about me?

238
00:31:08,230 --> 00:31:09,840
Am I not here?

239
00:31:15,890 --> 00:31:17,610
Don't you see me?

240
00:31:18,620 --> 00:31:20,200
I see you.

241
00:33:09,110 --> 00:33:13,310
But... I love Jason's money more.

242
00:33:55,290 --> 00:33:59,340
Are you Japanese? I'm Japanese.

243
00:34:02,430 --> 00:34:06,920
Are you Chinese? I live in Chinatown, too.

244
00:34:16,230 --> 00:34:17,860
You Korean?

245
00:34:19,750 --> 00:34:21,550
You're Korean?

246
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:30,260
I'm saved!

247
00:34:30,260 --> 00:34:32,990
Saved!

248
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,300
Tastes so good.

249
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:39,530
It's okay.

250
00:36:41,170 --> 00:36:43,000
It's okay.

251
00:36:47,210 --> 00:36:51,560
Love is just a game to me.

252
00:36:53,080 --> 00:36:55,590
Like Starcraft.

253
00:36:57,450 --> 00:36:59,940
Starcraft...

254
00:37:01,450 --> 00:37:04,170
Stay right here. I'll be back in no time.

255
00:37:05,090 --> 00:37:08,280
Okay. Goodbye!

256
00:37:25,940 --> 00:37:27,649
- Give me more.
- Not more.

257
00:37:27,649 --> 00:37:30,208
- Come on.
- Not more.

258
00:37:30,447 --> 00:37:32,787
- Come on.
- All right, one more. Just one more.

259
00:37:39,724 --> 00:37:40,994
Thank you.

260
00:38:17,608 --> 00:38:20,030
Hi, darling. How are you?

261
00:38:20,030 --> 00:38:23,889
Hi. How have you been?

262
00:38:24,933 --> 00:38:26,921
Thank you. Thank you.

263
00:38:29,008 --> 00:38:31,390
Check these out, man. What's that, man?

264
00:40:18,319 --> 00:40:22,033
Come on up on stage. Come on.

265
00:40:22,033 --> 00:40:25,589
Auction! Come on up on stage.

266
00:40:25,589 --> 00:40:27,651
Let's go, let's go.

267
00:40:27,651 --> 00:40:30,261
Auction! Come on!

268
00:40:30,261 --> 00:40:34,040
How much? $700? I hear $200!

269
00:40:36,876 --> 00:40:39,037
$400!

270
00:40:47,708 --> 00:40:49,610
A million dollars!

271
00:41:54,130 --> 00:41:59,280
Where'd you go? If you had come any later...

272
00:42:18,630 --> 00:42:19,900
Hey!

273
00:42:21,990 --> 00:42:23,670
Mister!

274
00:42:26,720 --> 00:42:28,080
Hey, dude!

275
00:42:32,000 --> 00:42:33,970
Hey, mophead!

276
00:43:31,620 --> 00:43:37,100
How beautiful! It's like a painting.

277
00:43:39,620 --> 00:43:43,040
Be my girlfriend.

278
00:43:44,180 --> 00:43:46,880
Perhaps I should abandon everything and live here.

279
00:43:47,570 --> 00:43:50,660
For the past three years, I could only think of you.

280
00:43:50,660 --> 00:43:52,440
I like you.

281
00:43:52,440 --> 00:43:57,950
Years from now, when I die, I'll come here to die.

282
00:43:58,910 --> 00:44:00,720
We can't.

283
00:44:00,720 --> 00:44:01,690
What?

284
00:44:01,690 --> 00:44:06,400
Since you're the person my friend Eunchae
most cherishes.

285
00:44:06,400 --> 00:44:07,970
You and me can't.

286
00:44:07,970 --> 00:44:10,890
What do you mean?

287
00:44:10,890 --> 00:44:14,470
Because Eunchae treats you
like her own flesh and blood.

288
00:44:15,730 --> 00:44:20,860
Instead of a flirt like me, meet a good woman.

289
00:44:22,660 --> 00:44:24,510
I swear I'm gonna die!

290
00:44:26,380 --> 00:44:28,920
I'm gonna die right here!

291
00:44:34,910 --> 00:44:36,970
Hey! Choi Yun!

292
00:44:39,010 --> 00:44:40,410
Choi Yun!

293
00:44:41,690 --> 00:44:42,860
Choi Yun!

294
00:44:48,370 --> 00:44:49,600
Choi Yun!

295
00:44:52,450 --> 00:44:53,780
Choi Yun!

296
00:44:54,600 --> 00:44:55,940
Choi Yun! Yun!

297
00:44:55,940 --> 00:44:58,340
Minju!

298
00:44:58,340 --> 00:44:59,650
Choi Yun!

299
00:45:37,060 --> 00:45:38,810
You're sleeping here?

300
00:45:50,040 --> 00:45:51,740
Don't you have a home?

301
00:46:33,470 --> 00:46:35,360
Mommy!

302
00:46:35,360 --> 00:46:36,650
Mommy! Ahh!

303
00:46:54,140 --> 00:46:56,030
Hey!

304
00:46:56,030 --> 00:46:57,340
Hey, Mister!

305
00:47:05,283 --> 00:47:09,434
Danny, how you going, man? Who's your girlfriend?

306
00:47:09,434 --> 00:47:14,190
- Get out of here.
- Alright man, cool it.

307
00:47:48,333 --> 00:47:50,008
Let's go.

308
00:47:57,570 --> 00:47:59,470
Mom...

309
00:48:11,230 --> 00:48:15,980
I have a husband! I'm married! With children!

310
00:48:15,980 --> 00:48:18,130
Just go to sleep!

311
00:48:18,130 --> 00:48:20,070
Unless you want to die.

312
00:48:50,120 --> 00:48:51,870
Oh, no...

313
00:48:55,426 --> 00:49:01,318
You okay? You alright?

314
00:49:08,560 --> 00:49:10,290
Are you coming to your senses?

315
00:49:12,070 --> 00:49:13,690
How embarrassing.

316
00:49:19,380 --> 00:49:21,810
I'm going to kill myself.

317
00:49:28,520 --> 00:49:31,140
I'm going to bury my face in the sand and die.

318
00:49:37,970 --> 00:49:41,550
I'm going to die! Drink all the
ocean's water and explode!

319
00:49:49,620 --> 00:49:51,880
I gave you fair warning.

320
00:49:53,260 --> 00:49:55,370
Don't say I didn't warn you.

321
00:51:56,910 --> 00:51:59,170
Wow, it's my bag!

322
00:52:03,340 --> 00:52:06,350
[Start paying attenshun crazee brat]

323
00:54:01,250 --> 00:54:07,090
The color sucks. It sucks.

324
00:54:24,940 --> 00:54:26,550
Give it here!

325
00:54:27,800 --> 00:54:29,840
A guy who can't even shave.

326
00:54:31,460 --> 00:54:33,840
Like this and like this...

327
00:54:33,840 --> 00:54:36,130
You have to go slowly...

328
00:54:36,130 --> 00:54:37,820
Okay. I'll do it.

329
00:54:37,820 --> 00:54:40,700
It's okay. I'll do it all for you.

330
00:54:40,700 --> 00:54:43,600
You just stay put.

331
00:54:43,600 --> 00:54:48,490
I'll groom your hair, and I'll dress you.

332
00:54:48,490 --> 00:54:50,760
I'll do everything for you, okay, baby?

333
00:54:54,000 --> 00:54:56,930
Come here!

334
00:55:00,110 --> 00:55:02,200
Oh, save me!

335
00:55:02,200 --> 00:55:03,740
Don't! Stop it!

336
00:57:42,591 --> 00:57:46,039
- Where's the bride?
- I don't know. Who are you?

337
00:57:46,039 --> 00:57:48,221
Where's the bride? I was told that she was here!

338
00:57:48,221 --> 00:57:50,535
How did you get in here?

339
00:57:58,520 --> 00:58:00,170
Muhyeok?

340
00:58:07,740 --> 00:58:10,430
I ate all the kimchi.

341
00:58:10,430 --> 00:58:11,570
What?

342
00:58:11,570 --> 00:58:15,260
I ate all the kimchi. Why didn't you make more?

343
00:58:16,191 --> 00:58:20,137
Oh, that. Sorry, I forgot. I was so busy, you know?

344
00:58:20,290 --> 00:58:23,190
- Let's go home.
- Why?

345
00:58:23,190 --> 00:58:25,100
To make more kimchi.

346
00:58:25,100 --> 00:58:26,800
What?

347
00:58:26,800 --> 00:58:30,410
Make more kimchi, then you can marry. Come out.

348
00:58:30,410 --> 00:58:33,070
Buy some at the Korean market.

349
00:58:33,920 --> 00:58:36,500
I don't eat kimchi that's not yours!

350
00:58:49,850 --> 00:58:52,710
How do I look? Pretty?

351
00:58:56,190 --> 00:59:00,980
Why are you dressed like that? I bought you a tux.

352
00:59:00,980 --> 00:59:02,790
Didn't you get it?

353
00:59:08,940 --> 00:59:10,040
Muhyeok!

354
00:59:13,360 --> 00:59:17,410
Let go! Hold on!

355
00:59:17,410 --> 00:59:18,580
Hey!

356
00:59:19,840 --> 00:59:23,250
Hey! Ow! Let go!

357
00:59:23,250 --> 00:59:26,170
Hey, let me go!

358
00:59:27,200 --> 00:59:28,560
Muhyeok!

359
00:59:32,350 --> 00:59:33,490
Muhyeok!

360
00:59:37,620 --> 00:59:39,660
Let go!

361
01:00:42,190 --> 01:00:46,040
My husband, Jason, can be very scary.

362
01:00:46,040 --> 01:00:50,910
Being in a killer mob and all. Did I not tell you?

363
01:00:52,680 --> 01:00:57,040
Turn the car around. Quit messing around.

364
01:00:57,040 --> 01:00:58,730
Let's go to our country.

365
01:00:58,730 --> 01:01:00,010
What?

366
01:01:00,010 --> 01:01:03,250
Let's go to Korea. Let's live there.

367
01:01:04,490 --> 01:01:07,860
There'll be a way for us there.

368
01:01:07,860 --> 01:01:12,270
We'll be able to live well there. If we go there...

369
01:01:12,270 --> 01:01:15,620
Turn the car around! I'm late to the wedding!

370
01:01:15,620 --> 01:01:17,400
Let's go to our country!

371
01:01:17,400 --> 01:01:18,930
Our country is here!

372
01:01:18,930 --> 01:01:20,192
Let's go to our country!

373
01:01:20,192 --> 01:01:24,045
Danny, please! I'm sorry, okay? It's my fault.

374
01:01:24,045 --> 01:01:26,826
It's my fault that I taught you
how to speak Korean, okay?

375
01:01:26,826 --> 01:01:29,406
I'm sorry.

376
01:01:43,730 --> 01:01:45,240
Then let's die!

377
01:01:46,460 --> 01:01:50,770
If we can't live together then let's die together.

378
01:01:52,640 --> 01:01:54,050
Muhyeok!

379
01:01:55,320 --> 01:01:59,690
When I'm born again, I'll come back a rich man!

380
01:01:59,690 --> 01:02:04,840
I'll become richer than Jason!
And I'll make you really happy!

381
01:02:04,840 --> 01:02:06,390
Muhyeok!

382
01:02:06,390 --> 01:02:10,840
Why are you doing this? Calm down!

383
01:02:10,840 --> 01:02:14,620
Say your prayers, if you want to. For the last time.

384
01:02:14,620 --> 01:02:17,650
Muhyeok! Why are you doing this?

385
01:02:17,650 --> 01:02:19,400
Calm down.

386
01:02:21,200 --> 01:02:22,710
I'm going...

387
01:02:24,090 --> 01:02:25,830
I'll see you in the next life...

388
01:02:28,040 --> 01:02:30,780
Oh, my. Oh...

389
01:02:31,670 --> 01:02:33,400
Oh, my...

390
01:02:34,490 --> 01:02:35,960
Oh, my god!

391
01:02:43,142 --> 01:02:46,516
- South Korea.
- Okay, passenger name?

392
01:02:46,516 --> 01:02:48,405
Song Eunchae.

393
01:03:01,570 --> 01:03:03,900
[Start paying attenshun crazee brat]

394
01:03:04,740 --> 01:03:08,300
- It's Kang Minju!
- She's so beautiful!

395
01:03:32,790 --> 01:03:36,420
What's with you? Go slowly!

396
01:03:45,760 --> 01:03:47,501
- Jason!
- Where were you?

397
01:03:47,501 --> 01:03:51,624
I'm sorry. Are you mad? You alright?

398
01:03:52,827 --> 01:03:56,689
I'm sorry, honey. It's okay.

399
01:04:04,183 --> 01:04:06,908
- Let's go.
- Let's go inside.

400
01:04:25,120 --> 01:04:27,850
How sleazy.

401
01:04:27,850 --> 01:04:29,920
I want some kimchi.

402
01:04:29,920 --> 01:04:31,856
You may kiss the bride.

403
01:05:41,190 --> 01:05:43,010
Muhyeok!

404
01:05:51,840 --> 01:05:53,440
No!

405
01:06:45,281 --> 01:06:48,098
[Episode 2 Preview]

406
01:06:48,098 --> 01:06:51,166
I love you too, Eunchae.

407
01:06:51,466 --> 01:06:53,375
I'll take responsibility for you.

408
01:06:54,673 --> 01:06:56,472
[Sorry for saying I want to be with you]

409
01:06:56,472 --> 01:06:57,748
[Together Forever]

410
01:06:57,748 --> 01:07:04,498
You saved our lives, so I'm sorry this is all I can do.

411
01:07:05,340 --> 01:07:07,465
[Love hurts like crazy]

412
01:07:13,569 --> 01:07:15,487
[And so that pain]
Where's your dad?

413
01:07:15,487 --> 01:07:17,095
I don't have a dad.

414
01:07:17,095 --> 01:07:18,722
He has your mom's eyes.

415
01:07:18,722 --> 01:07:22,633
Take me to my mother.

416
01:07:23,649 --> 01:07:25,339
[Turned into revenge]
